     <td style="width: auto;"> <p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">we may not be able to obtain and/or maintain necessary or useful licenses on reasonable terms or at all; and</p> </td>
