   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">The following table summarizes outstanding and exercisable warrants to purchase shares of our common stock as of <em style="font: inherit;"> March 31, 2023.&#xa0;&#xa0;</em>The weighted average exercise price of outstanding and exercisable warrants at <em style="font: inherit;"> March 31, 2023 </em>was $<ix:nonFraction id="c99232928" contextRef="d_2022-04-01_2023-03-31_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis-The2019EmployeeStockPurchasePlanMember" unitRef="USDPerShare" name="vtgn:ClassOfWarrantOrRightWeightedAverageExercisePrice" scale="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF">16.87</ix:nonFraction> per share.</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
