   <ix:exclude>&#xa0;</ix:exclude>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">Income tax expense (benefit) differed from the amounts computed by applying the statutory federal income tax rate of <ix:nonFraction id="c99232984" contextRef="d_2022-04-01_2023-03-31" unitRef="Pure" name="us-gaap:EffectiveIncomeTaxRateReconciliationAtFederalStatutoryIncomeTaxRate" scale="-2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="2">21</ix:nonFraction>% to pretax income (loss) as a result of the following:</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
