   <ix:exclude>&#xa0;</ix:exclude>
   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">On <em style="font: inherit;"> September 12, 2022, </em>the Committee modified outstanding options to purchase an aggregate of <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:c99233280">44,071shares</span> of our common stock exercisable at prices between $<ix:nonFraction id="c99233281" contextRef="d_2022-09-12_2022-09-12" unitRef="USDPerShare" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeLowerRangeLimit" scale="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF">11.94</ix:nonFraction> per share and $<ix:nonFraction id="c99233282" contextRef="d_2022-09-12_2022-09-12" unitRef="USDPerShare" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeUpperRangeLimit" scale="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF">53.10</ix:nonFraction> per share previously granted to a terminated employee and otherwise set to expire on <em style="font: inherit;"> September 13, 2022, </em>to extend the exercisability of such options for a period of <em style="font: inherit;">90</em> days. <em style="font: inherit;">No</em> other term of the options, including exercise price, was modified. We calculated the fair value of the modified options immediately before and after the modification using the Black Scholes Option Pricing Model and the weighted average assumptions indicated in the table below. We recognized the incremental fair value, $<ix:nonFraction id="c99233285" contextRef="d_2022-09-12_2022-09-12_AwardTypeAxis-EmployeeStockOptionMember" unitRef="USD" name="us-gaap:ResearchAndDevelopmentExpense" scale="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF">108,600</ix:nonFraction>, as a component of research and development stock compensation expense in our Consolidated&#xa0;Statements of Operations and Comprehensive Loss for Fiscal <em style="font: inherit;">2023.</em></p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
   <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2022-04-01_2023-03-31" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfShareBasedPaymentAwardStockOptionsValuationAssumptionsTableTextBlock" id="C97CC259-1F90-4ED8-A815-120AF5A33132" escape="true" continuedAt="c45479B9E-50A8-4422-99F2-D582D8BCDAE0">
    <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="finTable" style="margin-right: 2.5%; margin-left: 2.5%; width: 95%; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-indent: 0px;"><tbody><tr style="vertical-align: bottom;"><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; width: 68%; border-bottom: 1px solid black;"> <p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;"><b>Assumption:</b></p> </td><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt;">&#xa0;</td><td colspan="2" style="text-align: center; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);"> <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b><b>Pre-modification</b></b></p> </td><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; padding-bottom: 1px;">&#xa0;</td><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt;">&#xa0;</td><td colspan="2" style="text-align: center; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(0, 0, 0);"> <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b><b>Post-modification</b></b></p> </td><td style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 10pt; padding-bottom: 1px;">&#xa0;</td></tr>
