   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">We used the Black-Scholes Option Pricing model with the following weighted average assumptions to determine stock-based compensation expense related to option grants during the fiscal years ended <em style="font: inherit;"> March 31, 2023 </em>and <em style="font: inherit;">2022:</em></p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
