   <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">The fully depreciated office equipment reported at <em style="font: inherit;"> March 31, 2022 </em>was subject to a lease that expired in <em style="font: inherit;"> January 2022. </em>That equipment was replaced subject to a new lease in <em style="font: inherit;"> April 2022. </em>Future minimum lease payments under the new financing lease are as follows:</p>
   <p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>
   <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2022-04-01_2023-03-31" name="us-gaap:FinanceLeaseLiabilityMaturityTableTextBlock" id="c2409056" escape="true">
